  m_Name: case_7
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CaseData
  id: 7
  context: "THE STOLEN SUITCASE FROM VILLENEUVE STATION\nMonday evening, the jeweler
    Salomon Weil dropped off at 4:50 p.m. a gray suitcase containing \u20AC60,000
    in jewelry in locker no. 318. At 5:40 p.m., he finds the empty locker on his
    way back. The suitcase was found empty at 6:05 p.m. in a trash bin on platform
    3. Between 5:00 p.m. and 5:40 p.m., ten people were working or waiting around
    the central hall and the locker corridor."
  facts: "Detention ticket no. 318 issued at 4:50 p.m. \nLocker opened with the correct
    code, no break-in \n The camera in the detention center hallway does not film
    the locker entrance \n Anchor at the microphone at 5:25 p.m. (train from 5:42
    p.m., delayed by 12 minutes)\nA man with an orange backpack was seen in the hall\nValise
    found at 6:05 p.m. in a trash bin on platform 3."
